                <ITEXT FONT="DejaVu Serif Bold" FONTSIZE="16" CH="Patient Refusal of Treatment"/>
                <trail ALIGN="1"/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="136.001" YPOS="188.484076433121" OwnPage="0" ItemID="1971318161" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="538.59772611465" HEIGHT="403.337216831175" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="1" COLGAP="0" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L538.598 0 L538.598 403.337 L0 403.337 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L538.598 0 L538.598 403.337 L0 403.337 L0 0 Z" gXpos="136.001" gYpos="188.484076433121" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle/>
                <ITEXT FONT="DejaVu Serif Book" FONTSIZE="9" CH="The emergency medical services personnel of the Danielson Fire Department have given you this form to sign because you have refused emergency medical treatment. Your health and safety are our primary concern. Since you have decided to refuse medical treatment, please remember the following information:"/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="DejaVu Serif Book" FONTSIZE="9" CH="1. The evaluation and/or treatment provided to you by emergency medical personnel is not a substitute for medical evaluation. We advise you to seek medical evaluation and treatment from a doctor and/or hospital. By signing this form, you are refusing care against medical advice."/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="DejaVu Serif Book" FONTSIZE="9" CH="2. Your condition may not seem as bad to you as it actually is. Without proper treatment, your condition or problem may worsen. By refusing medical evaluation, you are taking responsibility for the risks associated with your refusal. These risks may include a worsening of your condition, disability, or even your death."/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="DejaVu Serif Book" FONTSIZE="9" CH="3. Medical evaluation and/or treatment may be obtained by calling your physician. if you have one, or by going to any hospital emergency department. Emergency departments are staffed 24 hours a day and NO appointment is necessary."/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="DejaVu Serif Book" FONTSIZE="9" CH="4. If you change your mind, or your condition becomes worse, and you decide to seek treatment, do not hesitate to call us back by dialing 9-1-1."/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="DejaVu Serif Book" FONTSIZE="9" CH="5. By signing this form, you acknowledge that your release and hold harmless the Danielson Fire Department, its members and rescue personnel, officers and board of directors, and all town or burrough officials responsible for the operations of the fire department, from all responsibilities for your well-being and all risks associated with your decision to refuse medical evaluation and/or treatment."/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="DejaVu Serif Book" FONTSIZE="9" CH="By signing below, you indicate that you have read or have had read to you, and understand the aforementioned information regarding the refusal of medical evaluation and/or treatment by the Danielson Fire Department."/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <para ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="DejaVu Serif Book" FONTSIZE="9" CH="Guardians: My signing as a guardian, you are indicating that you are the patient's legal guardian, and are acting on behalf of the paient's best interests."/>
                <trail ALIGN="3" LINESPMode="1"/>
